    },
    {
      "y": 132.739990234375,
      "size": null,
      "bold": null,
      "text": "前  言",
      "src": "figure",
      "role": "figure_text",
      "heading_candidate": true,
      "heading_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "y": 188.66336059570312,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "本标准按照GB/T 1.1—2009给出的规则起草。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 204.61660766601562,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "本标准代替GB/T 35273-2017《信息安全技术个人信息安全规范》，与GB/T 35273-2017相比，",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 220.21664428710938,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "主要技术变化如下：",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 235.46334838867188,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "——增加了“多项业务功能的自主选择”（见5.3）；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 251.06332397460938,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "——修改了“征得授权同意的例外”（见5.6，2017年版的5.4）；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 266.6633605957031,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "——增加了“用户画像的使用限制”（见7.4）；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 282.2933654785156,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "——增加了“个性化展示的使用”（见7.5）；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 297.8933410644531,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "——增加了“基于不同业务目所收集个人信息的汇聚融合”（见7.6）；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 313.4933166503906,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "——修改了“个人信息主体注销账户”（见8.5，2017年版的7.8）；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 329.0933532714844,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "——增加了“第三方接入管理”（见9.7）；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 344.6933288574219,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "——修改了“明确责任部门与人员”（见11.1，2017年版的10.1）；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 360.2933349609375,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "——增加了“个人信息安全工程”（见11.2）；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 375.8933410644531,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "——增加了“个人信息处理活动记录”（见11.3）；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 391.49334716796875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "——修改了“实现个人信息主体自主意愿的方法”（见附录C，2017年版的附录C）。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 407.4466247558594,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "请注意本文件的某些内容可能涉及专利。本文件的发布机构不承担识别这些专利的责任。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
